# Getting started

This page helps you orient quickly and choose the right next step.

## 1. Read the official docs first
Start with:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/extended-zones/

## 2. Decide what you are trying to do
Common goals:
- Understand what Extended Zones are and where they fit
- Check prerequisites and supported services
- Plan networking, identity, and governance
- Deploy / onboard an Extended Zone
- Validate operations and monitoring

## 3. Use this repo for community help
- If you're blocked or have a “how do I…” question: open a **Discussion** (Q&A).
- If you found a bug in docs or a reproducible product issue: open an **Issue** with:
  - region / zone info (as applicable)
  - subscription + resource types involved (no secrets)
  - steps to reproduce
  - expected vs actual behavior
  - relevant logs/error messages

## 4. Contribute improvements
See [CONTRIBUTING.md](../CONTRIBUTING.md).
